=== Headers ===
Header              Line  Category      Role in this compiler
------------------------------------------------------------------------
<iostream>          2     I/O           enables cout / endl  - std::cout / std::cin streams
=== Three Address Code ===
    outs "Hello, World!"
    outnl
    goto L1
L1:
=== Optimized TAC ===
    outs "Hello, World!"
    outnl
=== Program Output ===
Hello, World!
